<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>Returns the square root of float fValue. fValue must be positive or 0.0f will be returned.
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Remarks">Remarks</span></h2>
<p>fValue must be a positive number.
</p><p><br />
</p>
